module Encyclopedia where

-- Generated from the GBIF backbone facts fetched on 2026-11-11 (species-match API by scientific name,
-- synonyms followed to the accepted taxon): .tmp-night/fable-1111/pending/tree-of-life/facts.json, by
-- out/tools/gen_data.py. Groups are named by scientific name, species by accepted binomial (hybrid signs
-- dropped from the constructor only). No genus, order, authority, native range or life form for new rows
-- (ledger D8). The twelve species already described copy their facts from their records (D3).
-- Each living thing's label is the tree's own display name (life.fenel, encyclopediaLifeName: the first common
-- name, capitalised, else the scientific name), so a tile, a chip or a link reads "Fennel"; the scientific name
-- stays in the facts (scientificName), which the tree's boxes show as their second line.
-- Orange and grapefruit are one species at the source (Citrus ×aurantium): one living thing, two foods.

@label "Living Thing"
@description "A living thing of this collection: all life, a kingdom, a class, a family or a species. Each is a name; its facts, pictures and foods sit beside it."
LivingThing = AllLife | Plantae | Magnoliopsida | Apiaceae | FoeniculumVulgare | FerulaCommunis | DaucusCarota | ApiumGraveolens | CoriandrumSativum | AnethumGraveolens | PetroselinumCrispum | PastinacaSativa | Asteraceae | HelianthusAnnuus | HelianthusTuberosus | ArctiumMinus | LactucaSativa | CynaraScolymus | Solanaceae | SolanumTuberosum | SolanumTriflorum | DaturaStramonium | SolanumLycopersicum | SolanumMelongena | CapsicumAnnuum | Cucurbitaceae | CucumisSativus | CitrullusLanatus | CucurbitaMaxima | CucumisMelo | CucurbitaPepo | Rutaceae | CitrusLimon | CitrusAurantium | CitrusAurantiifolia | Rosaceae | MalusDomestica | PyrusCommunis | FragariaAnanassa | PrunusAvium | PrunusPersica | Fabaceae | LathyrusOleraceus | ViciaLens | CicerArietinum | ArachisHypogaea | Brassicaceae | BrassicaOleracea | RaphanusSativus | Vitaceae | VitisVinifera | Oleaceae | OleaEuropaea | Lauraceae | PerseaAmericana | Liliopsida | Poaceae | TriticumAestivum | OryzaSativa | ZeaMays | AvenaSativa | HordeumVulgare | SecaleCereale | Amaryllidaceae | AlliumCepa | AlliumSativum | AlliumAmpeloprasum | Arecaceae | CocosNucifera | PhoenixDactylifera | Musaceae | MusaAcuminata | Fungi | Agaricomycetes | Agaricaceae | AgaricusBisporus | Animalia | Mammalia | Bovidae | BosTaurus | OvisAries | Suidae | SusScrofa | Aves | Phasianidae | GallusGallus | Insecta | Apidae | ApisMellifera | Salmonidae | SalmoSalar | Clupeidae | SardinaPilchardus | Bivalvia | Ostreidae | OstreaEdulis | Malacostraca | Penaeidae | PenaeusVannamei

